{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Use simple instructions </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959370/extras/9cb55bfffebec58e5913f0519f3d3b60.avif?t=1761946285\" width=234 height=101 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">to perform simple tasks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959370/extras/836d1df63bc6d8a08b1569b5eb0942b2.poster.avif?t=1761946285\" width=742 height=661 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959370/extras/836d1df63bc6d8a08b1569b5eb0942b2.webm?t=1761946285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">or more complex tasks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959370/extras/24baa24e3b99cfc9b3a69e3c0c807c53.poster.avif?t=1761946285\" width=783 height=687 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959370/extras/24baa24e3b99cfc9b3a69e3c0c807c53.webm?t=1761946285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">by aligning the instructions on a grid:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959370/extras/4c1f90f99a17dcc074f5645bfeeebc93.avif?t=1761946285\" width=426 height=490 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">8-bitBot is about having fun finding solutions to simple and complex problems using basic principles of programming and watching how programs play out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Staying true to the name, 8-bitBot has hardware requirements that feel like a blast from a past: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The whole game requires only a few dozen megabytes of disk space and less than 100MB of RAM to run.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Also, the game comes with an awesome sandbox level editor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959370/extras/fd6aa98e8f96dc0f65b9f3f345ac0f6f.poster.avif?t=1761946285\" width=782 height=696 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959370/extras/fd6aa98e8f96dc0f65b9f3f345ac0f6f.webm?t=1761946285\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The rich sandbox configuration options allow setting up all options needed to create your own challenging levels:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959370/extras/3bd62f0ea414ee829e7c6b95a8a8eb0e.avif?t=1761946285\" width=922 height=527 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3959370?t=1761946285","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3959370?t=1761946285","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959370/0d6c8a38fb60bd31eaff796483a7